      "number_raw": "125",
      "source_number": "125",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "Ah, I picked it up here and there. Learned a little from an old singer at the Hub, and got some music from the scavs in Adytum, in the Boneyard. You know. Just takes some practice.",
      "source_text": "Ah, I picked it up here and there. Learned a little from an old singer\n at the Hub, and got some music from the scavs in Adytum, in the Boneyard. You\n know. Just takes some practice.",
